
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.GetAlpha(Face: number): number`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`float llGetAlpha(integer Face);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a float that is the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PBR_Materials#Nomenclature_changes" target="_blank">Blinn-Phong</a> alpha of <b>face</b>.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td>Face / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/face" target="_blank">face</a></td>
          <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Face" target="_blank">face</a> number or <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/ALL_SIDES" target="_blank">ALL_SIDES</a></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>prim</li>
        <li>prim_appearance</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">50</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
        <span class="attr-label bg-mandatory">Use Return</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <p>If <b>face</b> is <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/ALL_SIDES" target="_blank">ALL_SIDES</a> then the function returns the sum of alpha of all the faces on the prim, range <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetNumberOfSides" target="_blank">0, [sides</a>][[1]](#footnote_1).</p>
  <p>Otherwise the return is in the range [0, 1], with 0.0 being fully transparent and 1.0 being fully solid.</p>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>If <b>face</b> indicates a face that does not exist the return is 1.0</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`--Tells the owner the alpha on all sides
local function main()
    local i = 0
    local max = ll.GetNumberOfSides()
    while i < max do
        ll.Say(0, "Face " .. tostring(i) .. " alpha is " .. tostring(ll.GetAlpha(i)))
        i += 1
    end
end

main()
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`//Tells the owner the alpha on all sides
default
{
    state_entry()
    {
        integer i = 0;
        integer max = llGetNumberOfSides();
        while(i < max)
        {
            llSay(0,"Face "+(string)i+" alpha is " + (string)llGetAlpha(i));
            ++i;
        }
    }
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
  <h2>Useful Snippets</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`local function AveragePrimAlpha()
    --Since this is so simple you may just want to inline it instead of including the function.
    return ll.GetAlpha(ALL_SIDES) / ll.GetNumberOfSides()
end
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`float AveragePrimAlpha()
{//Since this is so simple you may just want to inline it instead of including the function.
    return (llGetAlpha(ALL_SIDES) / llGetNumberOfSides());
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`--if face 0 is "transparent" then make the prim "visible"
if ll.GetAlpha(0) ~= 0 then
else
    ll.SetAlpha(1.0, ALL_SIDES)
end`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`//if face 0 is "transparent" then make the prim "visible"
if (llGetAlpha(0))  ;
else llSetAlpha(1.0, ALL_SIDES);`} lang="lsl" /></div>
